<title>UK: SuedwestLB unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB unit sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTLB CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    10.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
